stateDiagram-v2
  %% Source: TaskProgressTracker (OnReviewSubmittedAsync, OnScriptRejectedAsync,
  %% OnRecordingReturnedAsync, OnPairDiscardedAsync), trg_review_majority in docs/codeswitchlabel.sql.
  [*] --> pending: pair added to recording task (create with assignees / add items)
  pending --> completed: both cs and vi recordings approved
  completed --> pending: a recording rejected, or reject-audio (KPI drops, task may reopen)
  pending --> rejected: script content rejected (script back to pending_validation)
  pending --> rejected: discard-pair
  completed --> rejected: discard-pair
  rejected --> [*]
